        "original_id": "b933992c-c75a-5713-a835-1442ed38b87a",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Kriti Sanon, Saif Ali Khan, Kareena Kapoor Khan, Deepika Padukone, Sushant Singh Rajput, Jim Sarbh, Naga Chaitanya, Brahmanandam, Ravi Babu, Pooja Ramachandran, Posani Krishna Murali, Sabbir Khan\n- Works: “Raabta” (song), Agent Vinod, Raabta, Heropanti, Dohchay\n- Awards: Filmfare Award for Best Female Debut\n\nFacts:\n- The song “Raabta” is a romantic Hindi song from the 2012 Bollywood film Agent Vinod.\n- The music video for “Raabta” features Saif Ali Khan and Kareena Kapoor Khan.\n- The remix video of “Raabta” stars Deepika Padukone, Sushant Singh Rajput, Kriti Sanon, and Jim Sarbh from the film Raabta.\n- Kriti Sanon’s first Bollywood film was Sabbir Khan’s romantic action drama Heropanti.\n- Kriti Sanon won the Filmfare Award for Best Female Debut for Heropanti.\n- Dohchay features Naga Chaitanya and Kriti Sanon in the lead roles.\n- Dohchay includes Brahmanandam, Ravi Babu, Pooja Ramachandran, and Posani Krishna Murali in important roles.",
